flowchart TB
  Banner[GitHub dependency alert banner]
  Triage[Triage dependency alert]

  Direct[Direct vs transitive]
  Scope[Production vs development]
  Reach[Runtime reachability]
  Update[Patch/minor vs coordinated major update]
  PR[Existing Dependabot PR]
  CI[CI evidence]
  Decision[Decision]

  Patch[Apply safe update]
  Defer[Document exception / owner / expiry]
  Reject[Close as false positive or non-reachable]

  Evidence[Security evidence record]

  Banner --> Triage
  Triage --> Direct
  Triage --> Scope
  Triage --> Reach
  Triage --> Update
  Triage --> PR
  Triage --> CI

  Direct --> Decision
  Scope --> Decision
  Reach --> Decision
  Update --> Decision
  PR --> Decision
  CI --> Decision

  Decision --> Patch
  Decision --> Defer
  Decision --> Reject

  Patch --> Evidence
  Defer --> Evidence
  Reject --> Evidence
